# Qwen 3.8 Omni Flash — findings by Nemotron 3 Ultra 550B A55B

- Source: Alibaba Cloud / Qwen (`qwen3.8-omni-flash`)
- Date: 2026-11-10 (UTC)
- Overview and scoring methodology: `../../model-comparison.md`
- Cross-model signed log: `../../model-findings.md`

## Model card

- **Name:** Qwen 3.8 Omni Flash
- **Short description:** Alibaba's omni-modal flash model supporting text, image, audio, and video input with text output. Part of the Qwen 3.8 generation, optimized for speed and cost-efficiency with 1M token context. Released via Alibaba Cloud Model Studio (百炼).
- **Provider / access:** Alibaba Cloud Model Studio (百炼) — API ID `qwen3.8-omni-flash`. Available in regions: Beijing, Singapore, Hong Kong, Tokyo, Frankfurt, Virginia. Chat Completions and Responses API. Also supports realtime variant `qwen3.8-omni-flash-realtime` for voice-to-voice.
- **Release / knowledge:** Release date not explicitly stated in docs (Qwen 3.8 generation launched 2026); knowledge cutoff not published.
- **IDs:** `qwen3.8-omni-flash` (Model Studio), realtime variant `qwen3.8-omni-flash-realtime`. No Free tier ID on OpenCode Zen.
- **Context window:** 1,000,000 tokens total; max input 991,808 tokens (non-thinking), 983,616 tokens (thinking); max output 131,072 tokens. Verified via Model Studio docs.
- **Modalities:** Text, image, audio, video input; text output. Reasoning: yes (deep thinking, default on, adjustable intensity). Tool calls: yes (Function Calling, web search via Responses API). JSON mode: supported. Audio: 113 languages/dialects, spatial audio support.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-10, China mainland):** Input ¥0.80 / MTok (≈ $0.11); Cache read ¥0.10 / MTok (≈ $0.014); Output ¥2.70 / MTok (≈ $0.38). International regions ~37% higher. Free quota: 1M tokens in Beijing region (90 days). Paid tier.
- **Architecture:** Proprietary (parameter count not disclosed). Not open weights. Part of Qwen 3.8 generation.

